      "description": "Category: Other\nClass: Demonic\n\nBalor\n\nMovement: Fly 80 walk 40\n\nSize: Huge -3 to dodge rolls\n\nClass: Demonic\n\nStats: 40 Body | 25 Mind | 25 Spirit\n\nAC: 14\n\nModifier: +6\n\nAbilites: Multiattack 1 whip attack and 1 sword attack\n\nFlamelick Whip\nDamage:  2 Body /2 Mind/ 2 Spirit Damage per strike.\nEffect: Those struck take an extra 1 Body Damage of Fire Magic, and must make a DC: 10 check or Burn taking a further 1 Body Damage.  ((Those with Fire Jewelry ignore this damage and the Burn effect.))\n\nThunderstruck Sword\nDamage: Thunder Struck Weapons do 2 Body /2 Mind/ 2 Spirit Damage per strike.\nEffect: Those struck take an extra 1 Body Damage of Wind Magic, and must make a DC: 10 check or be  Shocked from the blow causing them to take a -2 to their next attack.  ((Those with Wind Jewelry ignore this damage and the Shocked effect.))\n\nSpecial Abilities: Taskmaster (enemies hit by the whip attack must succeed on a DC 16 or they must immediately follow an order given by the balor.)\n\nHas access to hellfire spells.\n\nDeath throes: When the Balor dies it explodes dealing 2 body to everything 60 ft (succeed on a DC 10 on take no damage)\n\nWeakness: Light damage.\n\nTreasure: [Roll twice] (1) no loot, (2-4) 3 shadow-iron ingot, (5-7) 2 burning ruby, (8-10) 3 Liquid Luck potions, (11-13) 3 strength potions, (14-16) burning ruby, (17-18) 29 Anima orbs, (19-20) Demon heart.)\n\nAppearance: Standing over 12 feet tall with a wingspan to match, it's wreathed in fire, wields a flaming whip and a lightning sword, and radiates sheer destruction. Balors are cruel, commanding generals of demon armies, remnants of fallen celestials twisted by chaos. When slain, they explode in a fiery blast capable of incinerating nearby foes.",
      "full_text": "Balor\n\nMovement: Fly 80 walk 40\n\nSize: Huge -3 to dodge rolls\n\nClass: Demonic\n\nStats: 40 Body | 25 Mind | 25 Spirit\n\nAC: 14\n\nModifier: +6\n\nAbilites: Multiattack 1 whip attack and 1 sword attack\n\nFlamelick Whip\nDamage:  2 Body /2 Mind/ 2 Spirit Damage per strike.\nEffect: Those struck take an extra 1 Body Damage of Fire Magic, and must make a DC: 10 check or Burn taking a further 1 Body Damage.  ((Those with Fire Jewelry ignore this damage and the Burn effect.))\n\nThunderstruck Sword\nDamage: Thunder Struck Weapons do 2 Body /2 Mind/ 2 Spirit Damage per strike.\nEffect: Those struck take an extra 1 Body Damage of Wind Magic, and must make a DC: 10 check or be  Shocked from the blow causing them to take a -2 to their next attack.  ((Those with Wind Jewelry ignore this damage and the Shocked effect.))\n\nSpecial Abilities: Taskmaster (enemies hit by the whip attack must succeed on a DC 16 or they must immediately follow an order given by the balor.)\n\nHas access to hellfire spells.\n\nDeath throes: When the Balor dies it explodes dealing 2 body to everything 60 ft (succeed on a DC 10 on take no damage)\n\nWeakness: Light damage.\n\nTreasure: [Roll twice] (1) no loot, (2-4) 3 shadow-iron ingot, (5-7) 2 burning ruby, (8-10) 3 Liquid Luck potions, (11-13) 3 strength potions, (14-16) burning ruby, (17-18) 29 Anima orbs, (19-20) Demon heart.)\n\nAppearance: Standing over 12 feet tall with a wingspan to match, it's wreathed in fire, wields a flaming whip and a lightning sword, and radiates sheer destruction. Balors are cruel, commanding generals of demon armies, remnants of fallen celestials twisted by chaos. When slain, they explode in a fiery blast capable of incinerating nearby foes."
