      "full_text": "Bene Luxuria, Demifiend of Lust, (Left Arms)\nMovement: 30ft (x,y dash), 60ft (z, flight)\nSize: Medium\nClass: Aberration / Demonic\n\nBody: 8\nMind: 8\nSpirit: 8\n\nAC: 8\nCombat Modifier: +2\n\nAttacks:\nEight-Armed Deity: Bene Luxuria cycles through four sets of weapons, one in each arm.\nSling of Arrows - shoots an arrow at the target that must be dodged or suffer 3 Body damage.\nPoint of Daggers - stabs within melee range with a dagger that must be dodged or suffer 3 Body damage.\nRope of Submission - lassos a rope that must be dodged or suffer 2 Spirit damage submitting to the goddess. Pass DC 13 or be tied up and bound for 1 turn. Can be cleansed with purification spells. Contact with the rope also affects others.\nScepter of Truth - fires a bolt of lustful energy that charms the target to confess an embarrassing truth. Pass DC 13 or suffer mental harm for 2 Mind damage. (DC 10 for succubi/erinyes). Does not work under resistance to charming effects.\n\nAttacks:\nRed Room, Purple Room, Green Room. At the end of every Round, Luxuria (Left) will fill the room with intoxicating light. It steals affection with great delight. If you're caught, lose 3/3/3 body, mind and spirit. Solve the puzzle to not be near it.\nRed: Dawn unfolds in a vibrant hue, where nature is painting the world anew. First comes the red in a fiery rose, warming the earth as the morning glows.\nPurple: Night sweeps the purple in twilight's dress, a velvet cascade and a soft caress. Deep as the shadows when daylight yields, casting magic across the fields.\nGreen: Daylight weaves a cooling thread, under green blossoms and over our head. Moss on the stone and leaves on the tree, binding the colors in harmony.\n\nSpecial Ability:\nMultifaceted Deity - Luxuria can transfer herself between 4 statues to escape death, starting with less B/M/S each time. -2/-2/-2.\n[[ DM makes a /roll20 to determine loot drop.]}\nTreasure Table: (roll 2x) (1-2) No Loot, (3-4) 1 Ginger, (5-6) 2 Nightshade, (7-8) 1 Blood Moss, (9) 1 Sulfuric Ash, (10-11) 1 Mandrake, (12) 1 Iron Ingot, (13-14) 1 Abyssal Horror Bone, (15) 1 Corrupted Hippogriff Feather, (16-17) 1 Gazer Wing, (18) 1 Smoking Quartz, (19-20) 1 Judgment Ruby\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------"
